n\" name=\"Launch_0_description_loc[thai]\" value=\"\" lang=\"th\"><input type=\"hidden\" id=\"Launch_0_description_loc_tchinese__hidden\" name=\"Launch_0_description_loc[tchinese]\" value=\"\" lang=\"zh-tw\"><input type=\"hidden\" id=\"Launch_0_description_loc_turkish__hidden\" name=\"Launch_0_description_loc[turkish]\" value=\"[turkish text removed]\" lang=\"tr\"><input type=\"hidden\" id=\"Launch_0_description_loc_ukrainian__hidden\" name=\"Launch_0_description_loc[ukrainian]\" value=\"\" lang=\"uk\"><input type=\"hidden\" id=\"Launch_0_description_loc_vietnamese__hidden\" name=\"Launch_0_description_loc[vietnamese]\" value=\"\" lang=\"vi\"><select id=\"Launch_0_description_loc__select\" class=\"LocTextAreaLangSelect\" onfocus=\"LocUpdateLangThatHaveText( 'Launch_0_description_loc_' )\" onchange=\"OnLocLanguageSelect( 'Launch_0_description_loc_' )\"><option id=\"Launch_0_description_loc_english__option\" value=\"english\">English</option><option id=\"Launch_0_description_loc_french__option\" value=\"french\">French</option><option id=\"Launch_0_description_loc_italian__option\" value=\"italian\">Italian</option><option id=\"Launch_0_description_loc_german__option\" value=\"german\">German</option><option id=\"Launch_0_description_loc_spanish__option\" value=\"spanish\">Spanish - Spain</option><option id=\"Launch_0_description_loc_bulgarian__option\" value=\"bulgarian\">Bulgarian</option><option id=\"Launch_0_description_loc_czech__option\" value=\"czech\">Czech</option><option id=\"Launch_0_description_loc_danish__option\" value=\"danish\">Danish</option><option id=\"Launch_0_description_loc_dutch__option\" value=\"dutch\">Dutch</option><option id=\"Launch_0_description_loc_finnish__option\" value=\"finnish\">Finnish</option><option id=\"Launch_0_description_loc_greek__option\" value=\"greek\">Greek</option><option id=\"Launch_0_description_loc_hungarian__option\" value=\"hungarian\">Hungarian</option><option id=\"Launch_0_description_loc_indonesian__option\" value=\"indonesian\">Indonesian</option><option id=\"Launch_0_description_loc_japanese__option\" value=\"japanese\">Japanese</option><option id=\"Launch_0_description_loc_koreana__option\" value=\"koreana\">Korean</option><option id=\"Launch_0_description_loc_malay__option\" value=\"malay\">Malay</option><option id=\"Launch_0_description_loc_norwegian__option\" value=\"norwegian\">Norwegian</option><option id=\"Launch_0_description_loc_polish__option\" value=\"polish\">Polish</option><option id=\"Launch_0_description_loc_brazilian__option\" value=\"brazilian\">Portuguese - Brazil</option><option id=\"Launch_0_description_loc_portuguese__option\" value=\"portuguese\">Portuguese - Portugal</option><option id=\"Launch_0_description_loc_romanian__option\" value=\"romanian\">Romanian</option><option id=\"Launch_0_description_loc_russian__option\" value=\"russian\">Russian</option><option id=\"Launch_0_description_loc_schinese__option\" value=\"schinese\">Simplified Chinese</option><option id=\"Launch_0_description_loc_latam__option\" value=\"latam\">Spanish - Latin America</option><option id=\"Launch_0_description_loc_swedish__option\" value=\"swedish\">Swedish</option><option id=\"Launch_0_description_loc_thai__option\" value=\"thai\">Thai</option><option id=\"Launch_0_description_loc_tchinese__option\" value=\"tchinese\">Traditional Chinese</option><option id=\"Launch_0_description_loc_turkish__option\" value=\"turkish\">Turkish</option><option id=\"Launch_0_description_loc_ukrainian__option\" value=\"ukrainian\">Ukrainian</option><option id=\"Launch_0_description_loc_vietnamese__option\" value=\"vietnamese\">Vietnamese</option></select></div></td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td>This is shown to customers when they attempt to launch your application, but only in the event that more than one launch option is available for their operating system.</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td>Operating System </td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td><select name=\"osversion\" disabled=\"disabled\" onchange=\"EditLaunchOption_PlatformOSChanged('LaunchForm0')\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"\"  >Any</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"windows\" selected >Windows</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"macos\"  >macOS</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"linux\"  >Linux + SteamOS</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"android\"  >Android</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</select></td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td>Select the operating system that this launch option should be functional for</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td>CPU Architecture </td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td><select name=\"osarch\"  disabled=\"disabled\"  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"\"  > Any</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"32\"  > 32-bit only</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"64\" selected > 64-bit only</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</select></td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td>Select the CPU architecture that this launch option should be functional for. If you provide any 64-bit only launch options, then any 32-bit only options will become hidden.</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"oscpu\" value=\"\"/>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr  style=\"display:none;\"  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td>Owns DLC ID </td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td><input type=\"text\" disabled=\"disabled\" name=\"ownsdlc\" value=\"\"/></td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td>This Launch Option will be enabled in the Steam Client only when the user owns the DLC appID entered.</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr  style=\"display:none;\"  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td>Beta Branch </td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td><input type=\"text\" disabled=\"disabled\" name=\"betakey\" value=\"\"/></td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td>This Launch Option will be enabled in the Steam Client only when the user is opted into the specified beta branch. Supports multiple branch names, separated by commas.</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"realm\" value=\"\"/>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"steamdeck\" value=\"\"/>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</table>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</form>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<script>document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() { SetLaunchOptionDescriptionLocEnabled( \"LaunchForm0\", false ); }, false);</script>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<form method=\"POST\" onsubmit=\"return false\" name=\"LaunchForm1\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"sessionid\" value=\"ffffffffffffffffffff0001\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<table class=\"launchOptionArea\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td colspan=\"3\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"Flexrow\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Launch Option 1:</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"Flexrow\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<input class=\"btn_blue_white_innerfade btn_medium\" type=\"submit\" value=\"Edit\" name=\"editoption\" style=\"DISPLAY: block\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t   onclick='EditLaunchOption( \"LaunchForm1\" );'/>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<input class=\"btn_green_white_innerfade btn_medium\" type=\"submit\" value=\"Update\" name=\"updateoption\" style=\"DISPLAY: none\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t   onclick='SetLaunchOption( 1000000, {\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t   \"index\": \"1\",\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t   \"executable\": document.LaunchForm1.elements[ \"executable\" ].value,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t   \"arguments\": document.LaunchForm1.elements[ \"argumentsx\" ].value,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t   \"workingdir\": document.LaunchForm1.elements[ \"workingdir\" ].value,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t   \"launchtype\": document.LaunchForm1.elements[ \"type\" ].value,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t   \"osversion\": document.LaunchForm1.elements[ \"osversion\" ].value,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t   \"osarch\": document.LaunchForm1.elements[ \"osarch\" ].value,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t   \"oscpu\": document.LaunchForm1.elements[ \"oscpu\" ].value,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t   \"betakey\": document.LaunchForm1.elements[ \"betakey\" ].value,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t   \"ownsdlc\": document.LaunchForm1.elements[ \"ownsdlc\" ].value,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t   \"realm\": document.LaunchForm1.elements[ \"realm\" ].value,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t   \"steamdeck\": document.LaunchForm1.elements[ \"steamdeck\" ].value,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t   \"mapDescriptions\": ExtractLaunchOptionLocDescriptions( \"LaunchForm1\" )\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t   } );'/>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<input class=\"btn_blue_white_innerfade btn_medium\" type=\"submit\" value=\"Delete\" name=\"deleteoption\" style=\"DISPLAY: block\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t   onclick='DeleteLaunchOption( 1000000, \"1\" );'/>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<input class=\"btn_blue_white_innerfade btn_medium\" type=\"submit\" value=\"Cancel\" name=\"canceloption\" style=\"DISPLAY: none\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t   onclick='window.location.reload( true );'/>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td>Executable <span class=\"required\">*</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td><input type=\"text\" disabled=\"disabled\" name=\"executable\" value=\"SWMCPRec.exe\"/></td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td>Enter the executable to run when a customer attempts to launch your application. If your exe exists in a subdirectory, make sure you include the relative path as well as the exe</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td>Arguments\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td><input type=\"text\" disabled=\"disabled\" name=\"argumentsx\" value=\"-swmcp-rec\"/></td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td>You can include any necessary arguments here for Steam to pass to your executable when launching</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr  style=\"display:none;\"  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td>Working Dir\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td><input type=\"text\" disabled=\"disabled\" name=\"workingdir\" value=\"\"/></td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td>If you need to specify a  default directory (other than the game install directory) where your game will look for files and where Steam will look for the exe. This overrides the game install directory as the root for searching. If in doubt, leave empty.</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td>Launch Type\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td><select name=\"type\" disabled=\"disabled\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"\" >Unspecified</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option\tvalue=\"default\"  >Launch (Default)</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option\tvalue=\"config\"  >Configure App</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"vr\"  >Launch SteamVR App</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option\tvalue=\"openvroverlay\"  >Launch SteamVR Overlay</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option\tvalue=\"openxr\"  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tLaunch OpenXR App\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option\tvalue=\"othervr\"  >Launch Oculus SDK App</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option\tvalue=\"server\"  >Launch Game Server</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option\tvalue=\"editor\"  >Launch Editor</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option\tvalue=\"manual\"  >Show App Manual</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option\tvalue=\"benchmark\"  >Launch Benchmark</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option\tvalue=\"safemode\"  >Launch Benchmark</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"option1\" selected >Play %%description%% (option1)</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"option2\"  >Play %%description%% (option2)</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"option3\"  >Play %%description%% (option3)</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</select></td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td>Select the component or version of the application that will be launched by this launch option.</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td>Description </td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td><div id=\"Launch_1_description_loc__area\" class=\"LocTextArea\"><input type=\"text\" id=\"Launch_1_description_loc__textarea\" onchange=\"OnLocTextChanged( 'Launch_1_description_loc_' )\"><input type=\"hidden\" id=\"Launch_1_description_loc__currentlanguage\"><input type=\"hidden\" id=\"Launch_1_description_loc_english__hidden\" name=\"Launch_1_description_loc[english]\" value=\"Recording test option\" lang=\"en\"><input type=\"hidden\" id=\"Launch_1_description_loc_french__hidden\" name=\"Launch_1_description_loc[french]\" value=\"\" lang=\"fr\"><input type=\"hidden\" id=\"Launch_1_description_loc_italian__hidden\" name=\"Launch_1_description_loc[italian]\" value=\"\" lang=\"it\"><input type=\"hidden\" id=\"Launch_1_description_loc_german__hidden\" name=\"Launch_1_description_loc[german]\" value=\"Aufnahme-Testoption\" lang=\"de\"><input type=\"hidden\" id=\"Launch_1_description_loc_spanish__hidden\" name=\"Launch_1_description_loc[spanish]\" value=\"\" lang=\"es\"><input type=\"hidden\" id=\"Launch_1_description_loc_bulgarian__hidden\" name=\"Launch_1_description_loc[bulgarian]\" value=\"\" lang=\"bg\"><input type=\"hidden\" id=\"Launch_1_description_loc_czech__hidden\" name=\"Launch_1_description_loc[czech]\" value=\"\" lang=\"cs\"><input type=\"hidden\" id=\"Launch_1_description_loc_danish__hidden\" name=\"Launch_1_description_loc[danish]\" value=\"\" lang=\"da\"><input type=\"hidden\" id=\"Launch_1_description_loc_dutch__hidden\" name=\"Launch_1_description_loc[dutch]\" value=\"\" lang=\"nl\"><input type=\"hidden\" id=\"Launch_1_description_loc_finnish__hidden\" name=\"Launch_1_description_loc[finnish]\" value=\"\" lang=\"fi\"><input type=\"hidden\" id=\"Launch_1_description_loc_greek__hidden\" name=\"Launch_1_description_loc[greek]\" value=\"\" lang=\"el\"><input type=\"hidden\" id=\"Launch_1_description_loc_hungarian__hidden\" name=\"Launch_1_description_loc[hungarian]\" value=\"\" lang=\"hu\"><input type=\"hidden\" id=\"Launch_1_description_loc_indonesian__hidden\" name=\"Launch_1_description_loc[indonesian]\" value=\"\" lang=\"id\"><input type=\"hidden\" id=\"Launch_1_description_loc_japanese__hidden\" name=\"Launch_1_description_loc[japanese]\" value=\"\" lang=\"ja\"><input type=\"hidden\" id=\"Launch_1_description_loc_koreana__hidden\" name=\"Launch_1_description_loc[koreana]\" value=\"\" lang=\"ko\"><input type=\"hidden\" id=\"Launch_1_description_loc_malay__hidden\" name=\"Launch_1_description_loc[malay]\" value=\"\" lang=\"ms\"><input type=\"hidden\" id=\"Launch_1_description_loc_norwegian__hidden\" name=\"Launch_1_description_loc[norwegian]\" value=\"\" lang=\"no\"><input type=\"hidden\" id=\"Launch_1_description_loc_polish__hidden\" name=\"Launch_1_description_loc[polish]\" value=\"\" lang=\"pl\"><input type=\"hidden\" id=\"Launch_1_description_loc_brazilian__hidden\" name=\"Launch_1_description_loc[brazilian]\" value=\"\" lang=\"pt-br\"><input type=\"hidden\" id=\"Launch_1_description_loc_portuguese__hidden\" name=\"Launch_1_description_loc[portuguese]\" value=\"\" lang=\"pt\"><input type=\"hidden\" id=\"Launch_1_description_loc_romanian__hidden\" name=\"Launch_1_description_loc[romanian]\" value=\"\" lang=\"ro\"><input type=\"hidden\" id=\"Launch_1_description_loc_russian__hidden\" name=\"Launch_1_description_loc[russian]\" value=\"\" lang=\"ru\"><input type=\"hidden\" id=\"Launch_1_description_loc_schinese__hidden\" name=\"Launch_1_description_loc[schinese]\" value=\"\" lang=\"zh-cn\"><input type=\"hidden\" id=\"Launch_1_description_loc_latam__hidden\" name=\"Launch_1_description_loc[latam]\" value=\"\" lang=\"es-419\"><input type=\"hidden\" id=\"Launch_1_description_loc_swedish__hidden\" name=\"Launch_1_description_loc[swedish]\" value=\"\" lang=\"sv\"><input type=\"hidden\" id=\"Launch_1_description_loc_thai__hidden\" name=\"Launch_1_description_loc[thai]\" value=\"\" lang=\"th\"><input type=\"hidden\" id=\"Launch_1_description_loc_tchinese__hidden\" name=\"Launch_1_description_loc[tchinese]\" value=\"\" lang=\"zh-tw\"><input type=\"hidden\" id=\"Launch_1_description_loc_turkish__hidden\" name=\"Launch_1_description_loc[turkish]\" value=\"[turkish text removed]\" lang=\"tr\"><input type=\"hidden\" id=\"Launch_1_description_loc_ukrainian__hidden\" name=\"Launch_1_description_loc[ukrainian]\" value=\"\" lang=\"uk\"><input type=\"hidden\" id=\"Launch_1_description_loc_vietnamese__hidden\" name=\"Launch_1_description_loc[vietnamese]\" value=\"\" lang=\"vi\"><select id=\"Launch_1_description_loc__select\" class=\"LocTextAreaLangSelect\" onfocus=\"LocUpdateLangThatHaveText( 'Launch_1_description_loc_' )\" onchange=\"OnLocLanguageSelect( 'Launch_1_description_loc_' )\"><option id=\"Launch_1_description_loc_english__option\" value=\"english\">English</option><option id=\"Launch_1_description_loc_french__option\" value=\"french\">French</option><option id=\"Launch_1_description_loc_italian__option\" value=\"italian\">Italian</option><option id=\"Launch_1_description_loc_german__option\" value=\"german\">German</option><option id=\"Launch_1_description_loc_spanish__option\" value=\"spanish\">Spanish - Spain</option><option id=\"Launch_1_description_loc_bulgarian__option\" value=\"bulgarian\">Bulgarian</option><option id=\"Launch_1_description_loc_czech__option\" value=\"czech\">Czech</option><option id=\"Launch_1_description_loc_danish__option\" value=\"danish\">Danish</option><option id=\"Launch_1_description_loc_dutch__option\" value=\"dutch\">Dutch</option><option id=\"Launch_1_description_loc_finnish__option\" value=\"finnish\">Finnish</option><option id=\"Launch_1_description_loc_greek__option\" value=\"greek\">Greek</option><option id=\"Launch_1_description_loc_hungarian__option\" value=\"hungarian\">Hungarian</option><option id=\"Launch_1_description_loc_indonesian__option\" value=\"indonesian\">Indonesian</option><option id=\"Launch_1_description_loc_japanese__option\" value=\"japanese\">Japanese</option><option id=\"Launch_1_description_loc_koreana__option\" value=\"koreana\">Korean</option><option id=\"Launch_1_description_loc_malay__option\" value=\"malay\">Malay</option><option id=\"Launch_1_description_loc_norwegian__option\" value=\"norwegian\">Norwegian</option><option id=\"Launch_1_description_loc_polish__option\" value=\"polish\">Polish</option><option id=\"Launch_1_description_loc_brazilian__option\" value=\"brazilian\">Portuguese - Brazil</option><option id=\"Launch_1_description_loc_portuguese__option\" value=\"portuguese\">Portuguese - Portugal</option><option id=\"Launch_1_description_loc_romanian__option\" value=\"romanian\">Romanian</option><option id=\"Launch_1_description_loc_russian__option\" value=\"russian\">Russian</option><option id=\"Launch_1_description_loc_schinese__option\" value=\"schinese\">Simplified Chinese</option><option id=\"Launch_1_description_loc_latam__option\" value=\"latam\">Spanish - Latin America</option><option id=\"Launch_1_description_loc_swedish__option\" value=\"swedish\">Swedish</option><option id=\"Launch_1_description_loc_thai__option\" value=\"thai\">Thai</option><option id=\"Launch_1_description_loc_tchinese__option\" value=\"tchinese\">Traditional Chinese</option><option id=\"Launch_1_description_loc_turkish__option\" value=\"turkish\">Turkish</option><option id=\"Launch_1_description_loc_ukrainian__option\" value=\"ukrainian\">Ukrainian</option><option id=\"Launch_1_description_loc_vietnamese__option\" value=\"vietnamese\">Vietnamese</option></select></div></td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td>This is shown to customers when they attempt to launch your application, but only in the event that more than one launch option is available for their operating system.</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td>Operating System </td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td><select name=\"osversion\" disabled=\"disabled\" onchange=\"EditLaunchOption_PlatformOSChanged('LaunchForm1')\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"\"  >Any</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"windows\" selected >Windows</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"macos\"  >macOS</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"linux\"  >Linux + SteamOS</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"android\"  >Android</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</select></td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td>Select the operating system that this launch option should be functional for</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td>CPU Architecture </td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td><select name=\"osarch\"  disabled=\"disabled\"  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"\"  > Any</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"32\"  > 32-bit only</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"64\" selected > 64-bit only</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</select></td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td>Select the CPU architecture that this launch option should be functional for. If you provide any 64-bit only launch options, then any 32-bit only options will become hidden.</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"oscpu\" value=\"\"/>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr  style=\"display:none;\"  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td>Owns DLC ID </td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td><input type=\"text\" disabled=\"disabled\" name=\"ownsdlc\" value=\"\"/></td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td>This Launch Option will be enabled in the Steam Client only when the user owns the DLC appID entered.</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr  style=\"display:none;\"  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td>Beta Branch </td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td><input type=\"text\" disabled=\"disabled\" name=\"betakey\" value=\"\"/></td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td>This Launch Option will be enabled in the Steam Client only when the user is opted into the specified beta branch. Supports multiple branch names, separated by commas.</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"realm\" value=\"\"/>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"steamdeck\" value=\"\"/>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</table>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</form>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<script>document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() { SetLaunchOptionDescriptionLocEnabled( \"LaunchForm1\", false ); }, false);</script>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<form method=\"POST\" onsubmit=\"return false\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"sessionid\" value=\"ffffffffffffffffffff0001\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<input class=\"btn_darkblue_white_innerfade btn_medium\" type=\"submit\" value=\"Add new launch option\" onclick='SetLaunchOption( 1000000, {\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\"index\": 2,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\"executable\": \"game.exe\",\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\"launchtype\": \"none\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t} );'/>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</form>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Advanced Options</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grayRule\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Please use the advanced options with care. Please let us know in the <a href=\"https://steamcommunity.com//groups/steamworks\" target=\"_blank\">Steamworks Developer Group Discussions</a> before using these options unless you are familiar with them already.</p>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"advanced_options\" class=\"advanced_options\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><input id=\"useLaunchCommandLine\" type=\"checkbox\"  name=\"useLaunchCommandLine\" value=\"useLaunchCommandLine\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t  onclick=\"EditUseLaunchCommandLine( 1000000, $('useLaunchCommandLine').checked );\"/>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<label for=\"useLaunchCommandLine\">Enable using <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/doc/api/ISteamApps?#GetLaunchCommandLine\">ISteamApps::GetLaunchCommandLine()</a>. This will disable the warning popup in Steam when your app is launched with a command line.</label></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><input id=\"deckResolutionOverrideCheck\" type=\"checkbox\"  onclick=\"EnableDeckResolutionOverride( 1000000, $('deckResolutionOverrideCheck').checked );\" />\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<label for=\"deckResolutionOverrideCheck\">Override display resolution for Steam Deck external display</label>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"ttip small\"  data-tooltip-text=\"This sets the maximum display resolution the Steam Deck will allow when connected to an external monitor. If unset the Steam Deck will default to 1280x800 on 16:10 displays or 1280x720 on all others.\" >(?)</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<select style=\"visibility: hidden\" name=\"deckResolutionOverride\" id=\"deckResolutionOverride\" onchange=\"SetDeckResolutionOverride( 1000000, $('deckResolutionOverride').value )\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"Default\"  >Default</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"Native\"  >Native</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"3840x2160\"  >3840x2160</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"2560x1600\"  >2560x1600</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"2560x1440\"  >2560x1440</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"2040x1080\"  >2040x1080</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"1920x1200\"  >1920x1200</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"1920x1080\"  >1920x1080</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"1600x1000\"  >1600x1000</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"1600x900\"  >1600x900</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"1280x800\"  >1280x800</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"1280x720\"  >1280x720</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"1024x768\"  >1024x768</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"1024x640\"  >1024x640</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"800x600\"  >800x600</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"800x500\"  >800x500</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"640x480\"  >640x480</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"640x400\"  >640x400</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</select>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><input id=\"steamMachineResolutionOverrideCheck\" type=\"checkbox\"  onclick=\"EnableSteamMachineResolutionOverride( 1000000, $('steamMachineResolutionOverrideCheck').checked );\" />\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<label for=\"steamMachineResolutionOverrideCheck\">Override display resolution for Steam Machine display</label>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"ttip small\"  data-tooltip-text=\"This sets the maximum game resolution the Steam Machine will allow. If unset the Steam Machine will default to 1920x1200 on 16:10 displays or 1920x1080 on all others.\" >(?)</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<select style=\"visibility: hidden\" name=\"steamMachineResolutionOverride\" id=\"steamMachineResolutionOverride\" onchange=\"SetSteamMachineResolutionOverride( 1000000, $('steamMachineResolutionOverride').value )\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"Default\"  >Default</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"Native\"  >Native</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"3840x2160\"  >3840x2160</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"2560x1600\"  >2560x1600</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"2560x1440\"  >2560x1440</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"2040x1080\"  >2040x1080</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"1920x1200\"  >1920x1200</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"1920x1080\"  >1920x1080</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"1600x1000\"  >1600x1000</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"1600x900\"  >1600x900</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"1280x800\"  >1280x800</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"1280x720\"  >1280x720</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"1024x768\"  >1024x768</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"1024x640\"  >1024x640</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"800x600\"  >800x600</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"800x500\"  >800x500</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"640x480\"  >640x480</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"640x400\"  >640x400</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</select>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n\t<!-- Footer -->\n<div class=\"responsive_footer_ctn\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"footer_confidentiality_ctn\">\n\t\t\t<h2>Valve Confidential</h2>\n\t\t\t<p>This restricted access page contains Valve confidential information. You must have a non-disclosure and/or license agreement covering confidential information with Valve to use or access this page.</p>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"responsive_footer_content\" >\n\t\t<div class=\"footer_content_left\">\n\t\t\t<img src=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/public/images/steamworks_logo_white.png\" class=\"logo\" />\n\t\t\t<div class=\"steamworks_desc\" >Steamworks is the set of tools and services built by <a href=\"https://www.valvesoftware.com\">Valve</a> that help you configure, manage, and operate your game on <a href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/\">Steam</a>.</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"corporate\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"http://www.valvesoftware.com\"><img src=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/public/images/valve_logo_white_small.png\" /></a><span class=\"vr\"></span><a href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/\"><img src=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/public/images/steam_logo_white_small.png\" /></a>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"footer_content_right\">\n\t\t\t<ul>\n\t\t\t\t<li><em>Documentation</em></li>\n\t\t\t\t<li><a href=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/doc/\">Home</a></li>\n\t\t\t\t<li><a href=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/doc/gettingstarted\">Getting Started</a></li>\n\t\t\t\t<li><a href=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/doc/store\">Store Presence</a></li>\n\t\t\t\t<li><a href=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/doc/features\">Features</a></li>\n\t\t\t\t<li><a href=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/doc/finance\">Finance</a></li>\n\t\t\t\t<li><a href=\"https://partner.steamgames.com/doc/marketing\">Sales & Marketing</a></li>\